{
  "slug": "event-outbound",
  "name": "Event Outbound",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Create buyer-first email and LinkedIn outreach for B2B trade shows and conferences.\n\nGive event details, ICP, target personas, and sender context. event-outbound drafts pre-event, day-of, and post-event touches, then validates each one locally for channel length, subject quality, inbox preview, buyer focus, CTA clarity, forced event phrasing, and common AI-sales cliches.\n\nBuilt by Luminik from 20K+ outbound touches reviewed across 50+ events. Runs inside Claude Code with no extra API key.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `event-outbound` (Create validated email and LinkedIn outreach sequences for B2B events, from pre-event to post-event, grounded in buyer priorities…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install event-outbound@claude-community` from `luminik-io/event-outbound-skill`.",
